<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/rights> "This research is funded by dtec.bw – Digitalization and Technology Research Center of the Bundeswehr. dtec.bw is funded by the European Union – NextGenerationEU"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://www.iso.org/standard/20269.html> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/subject> "ISO/IEC 7498-1"@en .
