<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#hasDataUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a layer, or a communication itself, to the data unit it processes or transmits."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#hasDataUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Verbindet eine Schicht oder die Kommunikation selbst mit der Dateneinheit, die sie verarbeitet oder überträgt."@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#hasDataUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has data unit"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#hasDataUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "hat Dateneinheit"@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#hasDataUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "hasDU"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#hasDataUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "One relation with two domains: the content transmitted is assigned to the respective layer, or to the communication directly.\r\n\r\nhasDU is kept as an alternative label, since that is the short form the relation is commonly written as."@en .
