# https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#usesTechnology
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#usesTechnology> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#usesTechnology> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Layer> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#usesTechnology> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Technology> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#usesTechnology> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Relates a layer to the technology realising it."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#usesTechnology> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Verbindet eine Schicht mit der Technologie, die sie realisiert."@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#usesTechnology> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "nutzt Technologie"@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#usesTechnology> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "uses technology"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#usesTechnology> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Whether a given technology fits the layer it is claimed for is not checked here. Nothing stops a model from placing MQTT at the network layer."@en .
