# https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Application
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Application> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Application> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Layer> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Application> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Provides services such as file transfer or remote access directly to the application, using the services of the layers below."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Application> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Stellt direkt der Anwendung Dienste wie Dateiübertragung oder Remote-Zugriff zur Verfügung und nutzt dafür die Dienste der unteren Schichten."@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Application> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Anwendungsschicht"@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Application> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Application Layer"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Application> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "ISO/IEC 7498-1, clause 7.1."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Bit
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Bit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Bit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#DataUnit> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Bit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Dateneinheit der Bitübertragungsschicht."@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Bit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The data unit of the physical layer."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Bit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bit"@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Bit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bit"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Bit> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "The one practice term ISO/IEC 7498-1 names: 7.7.3.3.1 refers to the transparent transmission of bit streams."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Communication
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Communication> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Communication> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A connection between at least two system components describing the directed exchange of data."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Communication> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Verbindung zwischen mindestens zwei Systemkomponenten, die den gerichteten Austausch von Daten beschreibt."@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Communication> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Communication"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Communication> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Kommunikation"@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Communication> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "ISO/IEC 7498-1, definition 4.2.10. The standard itself calls this an association. Communication is the plainer term, and is the one used here."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#DHCP
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#DHCP> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#DHCP> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Technology> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#DHCP> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Dynamic Host Configuration Protocol, eine Technologie der Anwendungsschicht."@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#DHCP> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Dynamic Host Configuration Protocol, a technology of the application layer."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#DHCP> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DHCP"@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#DHCP> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "DHCP"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Data
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Data> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Data> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#DataUnit> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Data> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Dateneinheit der oberen Schichten, also das, was eine Anwendung austauscht."@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Data> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The data unit of the upper layers, that is what an application exchanges."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Data> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Data"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Data> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Daten"@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Data> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Not a term of ISO/IEC 7498-1 for a data unit. It stands for what an application exchanges, without separating the payload of a single transmission from a dataset as a whole."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#DataLink
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#DataLink> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#DataLink> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Layer> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#DataLink> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Bildet aus Bits Datenrahmen und regelt den Zugriff auf das Übertragungsmedium."@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#DataLink> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Forms frames out of bits and governs access to the transmission medium."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#DataLink> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Data Link Layer"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#DataLink> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Sicherungsschicht"@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#DataLink> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "ISO/IEC 7498-1, clause 7.6."@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#DataUnit
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#DataUnit> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#DataUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A delimited, coherent quantity of data processed or transmitted by a layer of the OSI model as one unit."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#DataUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Abgegrenzte, zusammenhängende Datenmenge, die von einer Schicht des OSI-Modells als Einheit verarbeitet oder übertragen wird."@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#DataUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Data Unit"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#DataUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Dateneinheit"@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#DataUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "DU"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#DataUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "ISO/IEC 7498-1, clause 5.6."@en .
