# https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Ethernet1000BASET
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Ethernet1000BASET> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Ethernet1000BASET> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Technology> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Ethernet1000BASET> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Gigabit Ethernet over twisted pair cabling, a technology of the physical layer."@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Ethernet1000BASET> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Gigabit-Ethernet über Twisted-Pair-Verkabelung, eine Technologie der Bitübertragungsschicht."@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Ethernet1000BASET> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "1000BASE-T"@de .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Ethernet1000BASET> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "1000BASE-T"@en .
<https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#Ethernet1000BASET> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "A class name beginning with a digit is awkward in a namespace, so the class is called Ethernet1000BASET and carries the practice name 1000BASE-T as its label."@en .
